    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto me, Go and get thee a linen girdle, and put it upon thy loins, and put it not in water.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I got a girdle according to the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and put",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "on my loins.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came unto me the second time, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take the girdle that thou hast got, which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon thy loins, and arise, go to Euphrates, and hide it there in a hole of the rock.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I went, and hid it by Euphrates, as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "commanded me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass after many days, that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said unto me, Arise, go to Euphrates, and take the girdle from thence, which I commanded thee to hide there.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I went to Euphrates, and digged, and took the girdle from the place where I had hid it: and, behold, the girdle was marred, it was profitable for nothing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came unto me, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", After this manner will I mar the pride of Judah, and the great pride of Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This evil people, which refuse to hear my words, which walk in the imagination of their heart, and walk after other gods, to serve them, and to worship them, shall even be as this girdle, which is good for nothing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For as the girdle cleaveth to the loins of a man, so have I caused to cleave unto me the whole house of Israel and the whole house of Judah, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; that they might be unto me for a people, and for a name, and for a praise, and for a glory: but they would not hear.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Therefore thou shalt speak unto them this word; Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God of Israel, Every bottle shall be filled with wine: and they shall say unto thee, Do we not certainly know that every bottle shall be filled with wine?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then shalt thou say unto them, Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Behold, I will fill all the inhabitants of this land, even the kings that sit upon David's throne, and the priests, and the prophets, and all the inhabitants of Jerusalem, with drunkenness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will dash them one against another, even the fathers and the sons together, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": I will not pity, nor spare, nor have mercy, but destroy them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Hear ye, and give ear; be not proud: for the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath spoken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Give glory to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God, before he cause darkness, and before your feet stumble upon the dark mountains, and, while ye look for light, he turn it into the shadow of death,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "make",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gross darkness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if ye will not hear it, my soul shall weep in secret places for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "your",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pride; and mine eye shall weep sore, and run down with tears, because the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD's",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "flock is carried away captive.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Say unto the king and to the queen, Humble yourselves, sit down: for your principalities shall come down,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the crown of your glory.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
